(7326693, 1143814, 177322, '<td valign="top">If, when preparing for this challenge, you visited Mr. Beguin''s web site, he has a section "Binomes - in pairs" where he sometimes matched humans against signs. I nearly flipped when I saw this shot; not only did it reflect inspiration by Mr. Beguin, this is in full stride* with his style.  I heartily applaud this image. Wish I could rate it higher, but I''ll have to settle for ten. <br/> <br/>*Pun slightly intended.</td>', 'If, when preparing for this challenge, you visited Mr. Beguin''s web site, he has a section "Binomes - in pairs" where he sometimes matched humans against signs. I nearly flipped when I saw this shot; not only did it reflect inspiration by Mr. Beguin, this is in full stride* with his style.  I heartily applaud this image. Wish I could rate it higher, but I''ll have to settle for ten.  *Pun slightly intended.', '2015-03-13 11:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
