(7327693, 1144177, 11769, '<td valign="top">sweet</td>', 'sweet', '2015-03-17 11:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327694, 1144032, 11769, '<td valign="top">whether we want it or not, it will come</td>', 'whether we want it or not, it will come', '2015-03-17 11:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327698, 1143920, 177322, '<td valign="top">I really want to examine the abstract quality of this image but it is so dark, I am thwarted.  Great textures, angles, geometric shapes. Nice sharp image.  Perhaps a tiny tweak in curves would have made it more explorable?   Forgive me, but a four from me because of the darkness not your eye.</td>', 'I really want to examine the abstract quality of this image but it is so dark, I am thwarted.  Great textures, angles, geometric shapes. Nice sharp image.  Perhaps a tiny tweak in curves would have made it more explorable?   Forgive me, but a four from me because of the darkness not your eye.', '2015-03-17 12:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327700, 1143914, 177322, '<td valign="top">The mirror of the curbing positioned against the swish of the strips on the gown works. Perhaps a bit too black at the top?  Still, a five from me.</td>', 'The mirror of the curbing positioned against the swish of the strips on the gown works. Perhaps a bit too black at the top?  Still, a five from me.', '2015-03-17 12:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327716, 1143963, 96751, '<td valign="top">What a glorious conspiracy</td>', 'What a glorious conspiracy', '2015-03-17 13:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327722, 1143914, 173844, '<td valign="top">This image exemplifies, to me, many of JJ''s personal artistic interests.  To wit, line, texture and people glancingly observed, all caught at a moment of harmonious composition.  There is also that quirky, tongue-in-cheek sensibility.  This is so beautifully done.  My personal favorite in this challenge.</td>', 'This image exemplifies, to me, many of JJ''s personal artistic interests.  To wit, line, texture and people glancingly observed, all caught at a moment of harmonious composition.  There is also that quirky, tongue-in-cheek sensibility.  This is so beautifully done.  My personal favorite in this challenge.', '2015-03-17 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327731, 1143671, 173844, '<td valign="top">In addition to the beautifully captured turkey (?) running across the road, and the do not cross lines, let me note, this image is all about atmosphere.  One could say it''s dreary, but I''d prefer to see it as nature all embracing.  It''s touching, mysterious and curiously balanced in composition and tone.  If JJ found himself in this setting, this would be a shot he''d take.  My personal second favorite in this challenge.</td>', 'In addition to the beautifully captured turkey (?) running across the road, and the do not cross lines, let me note, this image is all about atmosphere.  One could say it''s dreary, but I''d prefer to see it as nature all embracing.  It''s touching, mysterious and curiously balanced in composition and tone.  If JJ found himself in this setting, this would be a shot he''d take.  My personal second favorite in this challenge.', '2015-03-17 16:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327732, 1144149, 173844, '<td valign="top">A terrific take on JJ''s style --  great lines and perspective and a casually, adroitly observed figure who''s idiosyncratic and just out of reach.</td>', 'A terrific take on JJ''s style --  great lines and perspective and a casually, adroitly observed figure who''s idiosyncratic and just out of reach.', '2015-03-17 16:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327733, 1144146, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture.  The figures are half hidden yet casting magnificent shadows on a beautifully lit and textured ground.  A lot of joy here.</td>', 'Wonderful picture.  The figures are half hidden yet casting magnificent shadows on a beautifully lit and textured ground.  A lot of joy here.', '2015-03-17 16:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327734, 1144139, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsome tonal poem.  I like the utter white and black wedges jutting in from the sides and the highly detailed sky and rutted, puddled road from above and below.  It''s pleasingly asymmetrical.</td>', 'Handsome tonal poem.  I like the utter white and black wedges jutting in from the sides and the highly detailed sky and rutted, puddled road from above and below.  It''s pleasingly asymmetrical.', '2015-03-17 16:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327735, 1144144, 173844, '<td valign="top">Severe modern lines paired with more traditional structures, nicely conjoined by the steam and punctuated by a solitary,soon to disappear, figure.  Nicely seen and handled, well within and honoring JJ''s vision.</td>', 'Severe modern lines paired with more traditional structures, nicely conjoined by the steam and punctuated by a solitary,soon to disappear, figure.  Nicely seen and handled, well within and honoring JJ''s vision.', '2015-03-17 16:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327736, 1143716, 173844, '<td valign="top">Outstanding tip of the hat image that recalls "Eye Contact."  A pointed and lovely in its own right tribute to one of JJ''s best loved photographs.  And cuter, too.</td>', 'Outstanding tip of the hat image that recalls "Eye Contact."  A pointed and lovely in its own right tribute to one of JJ''s best loved photographs.  And cuter, too.', '2015-03-17 16:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327738, 1143725, 173844, '<td valign="top">The boys on the left alone would be a winning image, but it''s all lifted into a higher realm of interest when joined by the right hand portion.  It''s a fanfare of lines, shapes, reflections and mysterious figures.  A very fine example of the JJ style.</td>', 'The boys on the left alone would be a winning image, but it''s all lifted into a higher realm of interest when joined by the right hand portion.  It''s a fanfare of lines, shapes, reflections and mysterious figures.  A very fine example of the JJ style.', '2015-03-17 17:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327745, 1144066, 173844, '<td valign="top">An interesting and curious image that has a great sense of force flowing from the positions of the man and the tree he''s leaning against.  He''s almost a tree himself. I like the color tint.  While I''m not fond of the picnic table, it does seem to function as a visual anchor.  Much more to this than meets the eye.</td>', 'An interesting and curious image that has a great sense of force flowing from the positions of the man and the tree he''s leaning against.  He''s almost a tree himself. I like the color tint.  While I''m not fond of the picnic table, it does seem to function as a visual anchor.  Much more to this than meets the eye.', '2015-03-17 17:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327752, 1143734, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine, interesting and complicated image.  I very much like the choice of focus that leaves the main figure in concentrated ambiguity.  The openings, staircases and disparate lighting engender a sense of spaciousness in what could otherwise be felt as claustrophobic.</td>', 'Fine, interesting and complicated image.  I very much like the choice of focus that leaves the main figure in concentrated ambiguity.  The openings, staircases and disparate lighting engender a sense of spaciousness in what could otherwise be felt as claustrophobic.', '2015-03-17 17:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327767, 1144074, 3585, '<td valign="top">Nice mother and child shot. I like the reading aid.</td>', 'Nice mother and child shot. I like the reading aid.', '2015-03-17 18:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327769, 1143976, 3585, '<td valign="top">I like these pictures with lots of reflexions. they can bare two stories simultaneously or broaden the horizons of the image. This picture works for those who take the time; for others who breeze through a set of images, you need something in there that stands out and catch the eye on the fly.<br/></td>', 'I like these pictures with lots of reflexions. they can bare two stories simultaneously or broaden the horizons of the image. This picture works for those who take the time; for others who breeze through a set of images, you need something in there that stands out and catch the eye on the fly.', '2015-03-17 18:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327770, 1143936, 3585, '<td valign="top">I recognize that one. Thanks for the tribute. I remember spending agonizing hours on that one to make all parts of this otherwise dull subject stand out on their own. I treated the water, the buoy and the chain each on different layers, then blended them. That was a first. When depicting objects, get as close as possible and concentrate on tone and texture.<br/></td>', 'I recognize that one. Thanks for the tribute. I remember spending agonizing hours on that one to make all parts of this otherwise dull subject stand out on their own. I treated the water, the buoy and the chain each on different layers, then blended them. That was a first. When depicting objects, get as close as possible and concentrate on tone and texture.', '2015-03-17 18:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327771, 1144186, 3585, '<td valign="top">I like that one. This profile belongs to an old time friend of mine, same beard and nose, he is now a renown astro-physicist. And thats what he actually does for a living; he closely scrutinizes tarts and other significant galactic pastries.<br/></td>', 'I like that one. This profile belongs to an old time friend of mine, same beard and nose, he is now a renown astro-physicist. And thats what he actually does for a living; he closely scrutinizes tarts and other significant galactic pastries.', '2015-03-17 18:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327772, 1143734, 3585, '<td valign="top">A nice surprise. Shallow DOF is used here in a refreshing and unorthodox manner. The fact that the only truly sharp detail in the scene is the word exit is a added delicacy.<br/></td>', 'A nice surprise. Shallow DOF is used here in a refreshing and unorthodox manner. The fact that the only truly sharp detail in the scene is the word exit is a added delicacy.', '2015-03-17 18:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327773, 1144177, 3585, '<td valign="top">Would you have called that one crème brûlée it would have made me hungry.</td>', 'Would you have called that one crème brûlée it would have made me hungry.', '2015-03-17 18:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327774, 1144066, 3585, '<td valign="top">I hesitate myself...And trees rightfully worry about guys wearing lumberjack shirts</td>', 'I hesitate myself...And trees rightfully worry about guys wearing lumberjack shirts', '2015-03-17 18:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327777, 1144059, 3585, '<td valign="top">aa</td>', 'aa', '2015-03-17 18:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327779, 1144027, 3585, '<td valign="top">Do not signs have many charms, especially when they are facetiously indecipherable like this one. By focusing closer to the subject or by blessing it with the adequate human presence, this well toned picture could surely be improved. <br/>This location would be an excellent setting for an original engagement photo shoot...</td>', 'Do not signs have many charms, especially when they are facetiously indecipherable like this one. By focusing closer to the subject or by blessing it with the adequate human presence, this well toned picture could surely be improved. This location would be an excellent setting for an original engagement photo shoot...', '2015-03-17 18:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327780, 1143695, 3585, '<td valign="top">A very well composed, disorienting picture. The cryptic allegory could be confusing to some though. I usually can make sense out of caged Hope blocks topped with giant bed bugs...but then...it must be the jet-lag..<br/>Fine image.</td>', 'A very well composed, disorienting picture. The cryptic allegory could be confusing to some though. I usually can make sense out of caged Hope blocks topped with giant bed bugs...but then...it must be the jet-lag..Fine image.', '2015-03-17 18:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327782, 1144140, 3585, '<td valign="top">A delicate and witty tribute, thank you.</td>', 'A delicate and witty tribute, thank you.', '2015-03-17 18:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327783, 1144149, 3585, '<td valign="top">I once titled a picture in the same manner, didnt I? Nice lines and good use of shading. I took the liberty to turn this image into a vertical panoramic by cropping out the fences on both sides, the top sky as well; It does strengthen the composition for me.<br/>Also, I have this strong impression that this young women forgot to wear feet that day (?)</td>', 'I once titled a picture in the same manner, didnt I? Nice lines and good use of shading. I took the liberty to turn this image into a vertical panoramic by cropping out the fences on both sides, the top sky as well; It does strengthen the composition for me.Also, I have this strong impression that this young women forgot to wear feet that day (?)', '2015-03-17 18:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327784, 1144105, 3585, '<td valign="top">What a machiavellian title to this nicely toned portrait!</td>', 'What a machiavellian title to this nicely toned portrait!', '2015-03-17 18:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327786, 1144179, 3585, '<td valign="top">Fine portrait with an contextualized background.  The scull about to devour the gentlemans hat is definite plus. And would I be sarcastic, I would title this Love is looking in the same direction</td>', 'Fine portrait with an contextualized background.  The scull about to devour the gentlemans hat is definite plus. And would I be sarcastic, I would title this Love is looking in the same direction', '2015-03-17 18:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327787, 1144060, 3585, '<td valign="top">Looks like there will be some Candy Crush for desert as well. nicely composed altogether. Im not so sure about shallow DOF for street photography. In such mundane scenes, giving more visibility to the surroundings to contextualize is a plus I think.</td>', 'Looks like there will be some Candy Crush for desert as well. nicely composed altogether. Im not so sure about shallow DOF for street photography. In such mundane scenes, giving more visibility to the surroundings to contextualize is a plus I think.', '2015-03-17 18:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327788, 1144164, 3585, '<td valign="top">Perfect control of light and textures here. <br/>I understand It can hard to be simultaneously a photographer and an actor (I am assuming this is a selfie). Instead of staring at the phone, you could have thrown an empty and distraught look in front of you? That would have nicely filled with gloom the otherwise non-significant negative space on the left of the image. Good photographic work nevertheless.</td>', 'Perfect control of light and textures here. I understand It can hard to be simultaneously a photographer and an actor (I am assuming this is a selfie). Instead of staring at the phone, you could have thrown an empty and distraught look in front of you? That would have nicely filled with gloom the otherwise non-significant negative space on the left of the image. Good photographic work nevertheless.', '2015-03-17 18:16:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7327789, 1144156, 3585, '<td valign="top">The perfect psychopomp to lead us through the cimmerian shade</td>', 'The perfect psychopomp to lead us through the cimmerian shade', '2015-03-17 18:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327790, 1144171, 3585, '<td valign="top">Good portrait of a beautiful kid, Nice volumes in the background as well (a slight cropping of the clear space on the right could balance the composition I feel) <br/>I dont quite know what to do with your title though; did you feel your photograph was not able to convey aptly the story behind these eyes or is it some form of emotional staging ?<br/>Is this someone you know?</td>', 'Good portrait of a beautiful kid, Nice volumes in the background as well (a slight cropping of the clear space on the right could balance the composition I feel) I dont quite know what to do with your title though; did you feel your photograph was not able to convey aptly the story behind these eyes or is it some form of emotional staging ?Is this someone you know?', '2015-03-17 18:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327791, 1144148, 3585, '<td valign="top">I see there a tribute to high security thank you. <br/>The door I photographed then, I saw a few months ago, all revamped and horrid looking. Images remain.</td>', 'I see there a tribute to high security thank you. The door I photographed then, I saw a few months ago, all revamped and horrid looking. Images remain.', '2015-03-17 18:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327793, 1143725, 3585, '<td valign="top">To paraphrase you title I would say What is and could have been <br/>A good photograph with beautiful reflexions, the timing is spot on. If only this right arm on the left would have fit in the frame! Just a small rotation from a masterpiece.<br/>Hell is in the details.</td>', 'To paraphrase you title I would say What is and could have been A good photograph with beautiful reflexions, the timing is spot on. If only this right arm on the left would have fit in the frame! Just a small rotation from a masterpiece.Hell is in the details.', '2015-03-17 18:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327794, 1144139, 3585, '<td valign="top">This is how winter looks where I live! <br/>Good and aptly brutal landscape</td>', 'This is how winter looks where I live! Good and aptly brutal landscape', '2015-03-17 18:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327795, 1144184, 3585, '<td valign="top">A kind and soft portrait.<br/>Bens face gives me the feeling of being in between two expressions. People with lots of facial mobility require many shots before you get one where they appear settled in an expression you want to share. I never use my continuous drive function, except for portraits (especially group portraits) for that reason.</td>', 'A kind and soft portrait.Bens face gives me the feeling of being in between two expressions. People with lots of facial mobility require many shots before you get one where they appear settled in an expression you want to share. I never use my continuous drive function, except for portraits (especially group portraits) for that reason.', '2015-03-17 18:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327796, 1143814, 3585, '<td valign="top">dancer wear for example would have been kinder<br/>A nicely balanced B&amp;W</td>', 'dancer wear for example would have been kinderA nicely balanced B&W', '2015-03-17 18:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327797, 1143890, 3585, '<td valign="top">Nice! <br/>delightful contrast and setting and good textures<br/>And why not desaturating these little hands as well?</td>', 'Nice! delightful contrast and setting and good texturesAnd why not desaturating these little hands as well?', '2015-03-17 18:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327798, 1144135, 3585, '<td valign="top">Time and space play the blues. Reminds me of hotel rooms, melancholy by the mini-bar</td>', 'Time and space play the blues. Reminds me of hotel rooms, melancholy by the mini-bar', '2015-03-17 18:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327800, 1144154, 3585, '<td valign="top">This is finely inspired by a photo I am still most found of. The old man died a few years ago. his absence is still very present. <br/>Have you tried to square crop that one?</td>', 'This is finely inspired by a photo I am still most found of. The old man died a few years ago. his absence is still very present. Have you tried to square crop that one?', '2015-03-17 18:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327801, 1143920, 3585, '<td valign="top">It is a noble enterprise to seek harmony in unlikely settings. This is a good find.<br/>A few times a year I find myself, quite unexpectedly, facing a perfect scene (in places I never would have thought depicting); a wow, thats it! moment. Then one click usually does it. unfortunately these moments are too scarce. <br/>Continue to dig!</td>', 'It is a noble enterprise to seek harmony in unlikely settings. This is a good find.A few times a year I find myself, quite unexpectedly, facing a perfect scene (in places I never would have thought depicting); a wow, thats it! moment. Then one click usually does it. unfortunately these moments are too scarce. Continue to dig!', '2015-03-17 18:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327802, 1144146, 3585, '<td valign="top">beautiful image, superb timing and great light</td>', 'beautiful image, superb timing and great light', '2015-03-17 18:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327803, 1144180, 3585, '<td valign="top">This is an image of good company. Not sure why; perhaps I was there.</td>', 'This is an image of good company. Not sure why; perhaps I was there.', '2015-03-17 18:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327804, 1144128, 3585, '<td valign="top">A nice memory and well done image, thank you. <br/>At a garden party some years ago, she was a loud polish singer with an incredible lung capacity.</td>', 'A nice memory and well done image, thank you. At a garden party some years ago, she was a loud polish singer with an incredible lung capacity.', '2015-03-17 18:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327805, 1143763, 3585, '<td valign="top">I could have done that one! this would make a fancy large print. Great composition and textures. and thanks for the translation.</td>', 'I could have done that one! this would make a fancy large print. Great composition and textures. and thanks for the translation.', '2015-03-17 18:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327806, 1143925, 3585, '<td valign="top">Entertaining and puzzling greenery, and what are these barn-top nuts up to?</td>', 'Entertaining and puzzling greenery, and what are these barn-top nuts up to?', '2015-03-17 18:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327807, 1144050, 3585, '<td valign="top">Very good light texture and nice lines</td>', 'Very good light texture and nice lines', '2015-03-17 18:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327808, 1144097, 3585, '<td valign="top">Then the road becomes white, disappears, your car starts gaining independence and you soon wish you were ordering a drink in a warm cosy place. quality road pic.</td>', 'Then the road becomes white, disappears, your car starts gaining independence and you soon wish you were ordering a drink in a warm cosy place. quality road pic.', '2015-03-17 18:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327809, 1144106, 3585, '<td valign="top">Because your fish seem wiser than mine. quite an achievement, extremely well done, thank you.</td>', 'Because your fish seem wiser than mine. quite an achievement, extremely well done, thank you.', '2015-03-17 18:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327810, 1144133, 3585, '<td valign="top">Fine rendering of a depressed atmosphere. The wide depth of field lets me wonder and figure out were I am. Depicting acts of telephony are getting to be a major subject, rightfully so I guess.</td>', 'Fine rendering of a depressed atmosphere. The wide depth of field lets me wonder and figure out were I am. Depicting acts of telephony are getting to be a major subject, rightfully so I guess.', '2015-03-17 18:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327812, 1144144, 3585, '<td valign="top">Nice mix of hard lines and soft volumes, good street photography</td>', 'Nice mix of hard lines and soft volumes, good street photography', '2015-03-17 18:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327813, 1143968, 3585, '<td valign="top">Fine (French I guess) street scene; good processing given the difficult light situation. On the timing, I would have waited one second or a split, just enough time to have the third and less significant character partially leave the frame, the two main subjects remaining, standing out with their shadows intact. <br/>Photographers work intersects some times. Jaguars work overlaps with mine quite often. Im guessing this is one of his.</td>', 'Fine (French I guess) street scene; good processing given the difficult light situation. On the timing, I would have waited one second or a split, just enough time to have the third and less significant character partially leave the frame, the two main subjects remaining, standing out with their shadows intact. Photographers work intersects some times. Jaguars work overlaps with mine quite often. Im guessing this is one of his.', '2015-03-17 18:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327814, 1143716, 3585, '<td valign="top">Nice collection of faces. The duotone editing could be mine. The young chap staring at you makes me think of when Im asked for advice on street photography; I usually say: First, master the art of being invisible.<br/>Or is this a subtle tribute to eye contact? <br/>Tiberius?</td>', 'Nice collection of faces. The duotone editing could be mine. The young chap staring at you makes me think of when Im asked for advice on street photography; I usually say: First, master the art of being invisible.Or is this a subtle tribute to eye contact? Tiberius?', '2015-03-17 18:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327815, 1144108, 3585, '<td valign="top">The undeserved punishment of eternal boredom amongst decaying paint buckets, piping fixtures, unassorted nuts and bolts and an obsolescent rusty lawnmower. A very olfactive still life (for still life in French one says nature morte ...dead nature)</td>', 'The undeserved punishment of eternal boredom amongst decaying paint buckets, piping fixtures, unassorted nuts and bolts and an obsolescent rusty lawnmower. A very olfactive still life (for still life in French one says nature morte ...dead nature)', '2015-03-17 18:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327817, 1143923, 3585, '<td valign="top">Quite an enjoyable scene. nice find! I seems you tried to fit two pictures in one here, human interest and architecture. If you had moved your camera down diagonally to include more of the two thirsty gentlemen I feel your image could have been more compelling than it already is.<br/>I have a suggestion for a slightly less blasphemous title as well: The Sipstine Chapel</td>', 'Quite an enjoyable scene. nice find! I seems you tried to fit two pictures in one here, human interest and architecture. If you had moved your camera down diagonally to include more of the two thirsty gentlemen I feel your image could have been more compelling than it already is.I have a suggestion for a slightly less blasphemous title as well: The Sipstine Chapel', '2015-03-17 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327818, 1144068, 3585, '<td valign="top">Striking image! fine tuned processing. I have the impression of seeing a movie still. The characters intense expression leeds me to wonder what its all about (your tittle did not help me much); thats where the really shallow DOF gets in the way. Besides a ceiling, a light, perhaps a ventilator, the clues are rather scarce. A very good shot nevertheless.</td>', 'Striking image! fine tuned processing. I have the impression of seeing a movie still. The characters intense expression leeds me to wonder what its all about (your tittle did not help me much); thats where the really shallow DOF gets in the way. Besides a ceiling, a light, perhaps a ventilator, the clues are rather scarce. A very good shot nevertheless.', '2015-03-17 18:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327819, 1143721, 3585, '<td valign="top">Nice tonal work here. If I once see my work forged, you will be a choice suspect. Coming back once more on this image I definitively would square crop it. Nobody will miss the cars on the left and it would also strengthen the composition I feel. To my surprise I recognized this place from a series of photos I had seen quite recently. The spirits involved here are more bound to wine than the Arizonian arcane. Nice work.</td>', 'Nice tonal work here. If I once see my work forged, you will be a choice suspect. Coming back once more on this image I definitively would square crop it. Nobody will miss the cars on the left and it would also strengthen the composition I feel. To my surprise I recognized this place from a series of photos I had seen quite recently. The spirits involved here are more bound to wine than the Arizonian arcane. Nice work.', '2015-03-17 18:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7327820, 1144065, 3585, '<td valign="top">This is a picture worth much more than its truistic caption would suggest. What a blunt depiction of aging humanity! The dermatological nightmare that your processing has underlined manifestly overwhelms the conversation part of it, but thats ok. Strong image.</td>', 'This is a picture worth much more than its truistic caption would suggest. What a blunt depiction of aging humanity! The dermatological nightmare that your processing has underlined manifestly overwhelms the conversation part of it, but thats ok. Strong image.', '2015-03-17 18:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
