(7327824, 1144183, 3585, '<td valign="top">A grand classic revisited, fun and fetching. the dead center character is perfect there. A slight tilt up to get a little less pavement and a little more of this chicagoan massacre on top would not change much but would fit everything a little more neatly in the frame.<br/>A great shot in any case. Was this staged?</td>', 'A grand classic revisited, fun and fetching. the dead center character is perfect there. A slight tilt up to get a little less pavement and a little more of this chicagoan massacre on top would not change much but would fit everything a little more neatly in the frame.A great shot in any case. Was this staged?', '2015-03-17 18:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
