(7330227, 1143920, 173844, '<td valign="top">A measured harmony emerges out of a seemingly prosaic setting.  I admire the eye that is attentive to such sweet compositions.</td>', 'A measured harmony emerges out of a seemingly prosaic setting.  I admire the eye that is attentive to such sweet compositions.', '2015-03-19 09:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330231, 1143905, 173844, '<td valign="top">It took some effort before I was able to move beyond the shard of mirror interpretation, such is the compelling force of this image.  I''ll ascribe it to magic.  I''d put this one on my wall.</td>', 'It took some effort before I was able to move beyond the shard of mirror interpretation, such is the compelling force of this image.  I''ll ascribe it to magic.  I''d put this one on my wall.', '2015-03-19 09:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330232, 1143767, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fascinating scene with a post-apocalyptic feel.  Fine lines, shapes and grittiness.  But what ultimately makes this image for me is the unusual color combination of thick pink and heightened olive, with a stripe of blue.</td>', 'Fascinating scene with a post-apocalyptic feel.  Fine lines, shapes and grittiness.  But what ultimately makes this image for me is the unusual color combination of thick pink and heightened olive, with a stripe of blue.', '2015-03-19 09:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330237, 1144059, 173844, '<td valign="top">Several layers of invisibility here, and only the boy has his foot firmly in the moment.  Very nice utilization of black and white.</td>', 'Several layers of invisibility here, and only the boy has his foot firmly in the moment.  Very nice utilization of black and white.', '2015-03-19 09:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330248, 1144065, 173844, '<td valign="top">The processing brings out the detail of their skin which cleverly assists the depth, in years, of their interplay.  Great feeling of intimacy.  The sign, too, is poignant.</td>', 'The processing brings out the detail of their skin which cleverly assists the depth, in years, of their interplay.  Great feeling of intimacy.  The sign, too, is poignant.', '2015-03-19 09:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330256, 1144092, 173844, '<td valign="top">This casual feeling shot of an undulating shoreline pays nice tribute to JJ''s affection for the ocean.  The color tone is suitably modest and the white vignette works for me.</td>', 'This casual feeling shot of an undulating shoreline pays nice tribute to JJ''s affection for the ocean.  The color tone is suitably modest and the white vignette works for me.', '2015-03-19 09:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330263, 1144142, 173844, '<td valign="top">A comfortable, offhand composition that, with its contrasting jumble of chairs, affectionate look at meter boxes and their conduit pipes and cheerful light affords me pleasure.</td>', 'A comfortable, offhand composition that, with its contrasting jumble of chairs, affectionate look at meter boxes and their conduit pipes and cheerful light affords me pleasure.', '2015-03-19 09:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330265, 1144154, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit, seems rather posed, but forcefully conveys its brooding mood.  I like the doubled reflection of the window.</td>', 'Nicely lit, seems rather posed, but forcefully conveys its brooding mood.  I like the doubled reflection of the window.', '2015-03-19 10:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330267, 1144140, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fascinating glimpse into a hidden, for me, world.  Almost a shotgun marriage of items, but it comes together convincingly and pleasingly.  Really good.</td>', 'Fascinating glimpse into a hidden, for me, world.  Almost a shotgun marriage of items, but it comes together convincingly and pleasingly.  Really good.', '2015-03-19 10:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330270, 1143763, 11769, '<td valign="top">really like the composition</td>', 'really like the composition', '2015-03-19 10:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330271, 1144186, 173844, '<td valign="top">Unusual, creative, thought-provoking and enjoyable.  Experimentation of the highest order.</td>', 'Unusual, creative, thought-provoking and enjoyable.  Experimentation of the highest order.', '2015-03-19 10:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330272, 1144135, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice, jarring contrast between the street scene and the reflected bedroom.  It''s just wonderful how the bed floats above it all like a flying carpet.</td>', 'Nice, jarring contrast between the street scene and the reflected bedroom.  It''s just wonderful how the bed floats above it all like a flying carpet.', '2015-03-19 10:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330274, 1143763, 173844, '<td valign="top">Good use of texture, line, perspective and reflection.  A gentle appreciation.</td>', 'Good use of texture, line, perspective and reflection.  A gentle appreciation.', '2015-03-19 10:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330276, 1143931, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like her looming attentiveness and how she fills up the frame.  Her moist eyes are terrific, and the background semi-distinct bokeh works well.</td>', 'I like her looming attentiveness and how she fills up the frame.  Her moist eyes are terrific, and the background semi-distinct bokeh works well.', '2015-03-19 10:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330277, 1144106, 173844, '<td valign="top">A strong homage to one of JJ''s fish images.  Beautiful depth of field and processing.</td>', 'A strong homage to one of JJ''s fish images.  Beautiful depth of field and processing.', '2015-03-19 10:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330282, 1144067, 173844, '<td valign="top">Minimal, mysterious and appealing.  Fine composition and exposure.  Claustrophobic.</td>', 'Minimal, mysterious and appealing.  Fine composition and exposure.  Claustrophobic.', '2015-03-19 10:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330285, 1144108, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting menagerie of objects.</td>', 'Interesting menagerie of objects.', '2015-03-19 10:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330291, 1144170, 173844, '<td valign="top">And noisy; I get it.  I like it as an insistent study of line and shape.  The bells toll for thee.</td>', 'And noisy; I get it.  I like it as an insistent study of line and shape.  The bells toll for thee.', '2015-03-19 10:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330296, 1144156, 173844, '<td valign="top">Don''t care why it looks this way, only know that I like it.  A pure expression of a cat''s world.</td>', 'Don''t care why it looks this way, only know that I like it.  A pure expression of a cat''s world.', '2015-03-19 10:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330298, 1144068, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautifully focused and processed, great intensity and stellar bokeh.</td>', 'Beautifully focused and processed, great intensity and stellar bokeh.', '2015-03-19 10:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330299, 1143963, 173844, '<td valign="top">Precise capture.  Moving.</td>', 'Precise capture.  Moving.', '2015-03-19 10:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330303, 1143969, 173844, '<td valign="top">A crowd scene like JJ is partial towards.  Quite symphonic.  The woman with the crutches deepens it yet further.</td>', 'A crowd scene like JJ is partial towards.  Quite symphonic.  The woman with the crutches deepens it yet further.', '2015-03-19 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330304, 1144097, 173844, '<td valign="top">Quirky and captivating.  Like sparks coming off a grinding wheel.</td>', 'Quirky and captivating.  Like sparks coming off a grinding wheel.', '2015-03-19 10:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330305, 1144128, 173844, '<td valign="top">Clever perspective and quite attractive.</td>', 'Clever perspective and quite attractive.', '2015-03-19 10:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330308, 1144050, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light.</td>', 'Wonderful light.', '2015-03-19 10:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330309, 1144133, 173844, '<td valign="top">Strong sense of calm.</td>', 'Strong sense of calm.', '2015-03-19 10:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330310, 1143924, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the processing.</td>', 'I like the processing.', '2015-03-19 10:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
