(7330313, 1144171, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine portrait.  A square format might allow her face to fill the frame more, if that would be a direction you''d want to take it.</td>', 'Fine portrait.  A square format might allow her face to fill the frame more, if that would be a direction you''d want to take it.', '2015-03-19 10:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330315, 1144167, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice study of leaves and roots, though I find the open area to be a bit bare.</td>', 'Nice study of leaves and roots, though I find the open area to be a bit bare.', '2015-03-19 10:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330385, 1144146, 70270, '<td valign="top">Tops in the challenge, 10 from me.  Is this the real deal?</td>', 'Tops in the challenge, 10 from me.  Is this the real deal?', '2015-03-19 13:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330387, 1143923, 70270, '<td valign="top">Great slice of life, a 9 and the red from me.  Good luck!</td>', 'Great slice of life, a 9 and the red from me.  Good luck!', '2015-03-19 13:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330389, 1144181, 70270, '<td valign="top">What does it all mean?  Makes you stop and think about Faithery.</td>', 'What does it all mean?  Makes you stop and think about Faithery.', '2015-03-19 13:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330390, 1143968, 70270, '<td valign="top">The tones are great, and the setting makes me thing this could be a genuine jjbeguin.  Its a nice slice of life, but lacks a story or sense of mystery.  Still an 8 from me.</td>', 'The tones are great, and the setting makes me thing this could be a genuine jjbeguin.  Its a nice slice of life, but lacks a story or sense of mystery.  Still an 8 from me.', '2015-03-19 13:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330443, 1143925, 20799, '<td valign="top">Too good to be true.</td>', 'Too good to be true.', '2015-03-19 16:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330446, 1144185, 156466, '<td valign="top">Man, I love this.  I''m not sure if the more shallow DoF is an homage to jjbeguin or not, but since I haven''t been here long enough to get a feel for the style I''m just going on the photos and that''s the only thing that bugs me - and even then it''s just the nose, not the finger.  Powerful shot nonetheless. 9</td>', 'Man, I love this.  I''m not sure if the more shallow DoF is an homage to jjbeguin or not, but since I haven''t been here long enough to get a feel for the style I''m just going on the photos and that''s the only thing that bugs me - and even then it''s just the nose, not the finger.  Powerful shot nonetheless. 9', '2015-03-19 16:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330447, 1144164, 156466, '<td valign="top">Title makes me want to know that it''s not just a bad text.</td>', 'Title makes me want to know that it''s not just a bad text.', '2015-03-19 16:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330448, 1144140, 20799, '<td valign="top">Good tribute. The secret agent turned into a gremlin.</td>', 'Good tribute. The secret agent turned into a gremlin.', '2015-03-19 16:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330449, 1143936, 156466, '<td valign="top">This feels like it''s moving left, which has me wanting this to be more of a center composition to give it somewhere to go.  Otherwise I like it a lot.</td>', 'This feels like it''s moving left, which has me wanting this to be more of a center composition to give it somewhere to go.  Otherwise I like it a lot.', '2015-03-19 16:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330450, 1143963, 20799, '<td valign="top">I gave many 8s and 9s but kept the 10 for you.</td>', 'I gave many 8s and 9s but kept the 10 for you.', '2015-03-19 16:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330451, 1143969, 156466, '<td valign="top">I love this, but want something to grab me out of the mob scene and it doesn''t.  Some vignetting and burning, perhaps?</td>', 'I love this, but want something to grab me out of the mob scene and it doesn''t.  Some vignetting and burning, perhaps?', '2015-03-19 16:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
