(7330455, 1144055, 156466, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if I''m intrigued more by the photo or by the statue shot.  Great treatment, though I might have preferred a center composition.</td>', 'I don''t know if I''m intrigued more by the photo or by the statue shot.  Great treatment, though I might have preferred a center composition.', '2015-03-19 16:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
