(7330466, 1143767, 156466, '<td valign="top">Not crazy about the colors and would love a bit of perspective correction.  A different angle emphasizing both dials, perhaps?  6 that I want to be higher.</td>', 'Not crazy about the colors and would love a bit of perspective correction.  A different angle emphasizing both dials, perhaps?  6 that I want to be higher.', '2015-03-19 16:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330467, 1143725, 156466, '<td valign="top">I wish my eye wasn''t drawn to the line in the middle, because each side is wonderful.  But everything in the composition draws me to the noise.  Generous 7 because of just how good everything else is.</td>', 'I wish my eye wasn''t drawn to the line in the middle, because each side is wonderful.  But everything in the composition draws me to the noise.  Generous 7 because of just how good everything else is.', '2015-03-19 16:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
