(7330747, 1143734, 94815, '<td valign="top">Very expressive interpretation. Focusing on the environment instead of the protagonist may be unexpected but so powerfully makes the point. I''m so moved and won''t forget it.</td>', 'Very expressive interpretation. Focusing on the environment instead of the protagonist may be unexpected but so powerfully makes the point. I''m so moved and won''t forget it.', '2015-03-19 22:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330748, 1143671, 94815, '<td valign="top">There''s a sympathetic if understated humanism here even without explicit human activity. Just a turkey after all - normally the subject of sarcasm by us higher forms but here not so. This image could be a classic and certainly a favorite of mine.</td>', 'There''s a sympathetic if understated humanism here even without explicit human activity. Just a turkey after all - normally the subject of sarcasm by us higher forms but here not so. This image could be a classic and certainly a favorite of mine.', '2015-03-19 22:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
