(7330756, 1144144, 94815, '<td valign="top">Very strong image won''t quickly fade from memory and if it does will demand refreshing. This is an example of how a single element not only ties it all together while providing that essential opposite to make the point. The statuesque solitary person among all the modern chaos makes it work. Hard to imagine how it could be improved.</td>', 'Very strong image won''t quickly fade from memory and if it does will demand refreshing. This is an example of how a single element not only ties it all together while providing that essential opposite to make the point. The statuesque solitary person among all the modern chaos makes it work. Hard to imagine how it could be improved.', '2015-03-19 22:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
