(7330859, 1144059, 3585, '<td valign="top">something must have happened here, not quite sure what...?<br/>This was my comment:<br/>This blunt and moody street scene has some charms. Telephony, once more, provides the only vehicle for human interaction. Not so sure about the title, the sitting man may feel ignored and invisible at times but, for us passers by, they are so visible that their presence creeps on us long after our eye have turned away.<br/></td>', 'something must have happened here, not quite sure what...?This was my comment:This blunt and moody street scene has some charms. Telephony, once more, provides the only vehicle for human interaction. Not so sure about the title, the sitting man may feel ignored and invisible at times but, for us passers by, they are so visible that their presence creeps on us long after our eye have turned away.', '2015-03-20 05:13:40.000000', NULL, 0),
